     "State-space page methods (common to its figures): signal = Allen-area means (62 areas incl. the ALM / tjM1 ROIs, both hemispheres; image left = ipsilesional) of the adopted hemodynamics-corrected SVD (meegkit_hpfit_lag_refitT, LocaNMF projection), slow drift removed, dF/F x1e3. Trials: engaged trials (engagement gate) with a first lick between the cue and the trial stop (3.5 s if none); first lick = the first camera (LP) lick onset, not the DAQ lick sensor; primary set = contact + incomplete first licks (contact flag = the 3-D first lick matched to the trial). Cohort 1 only (PS92-95), August-only pre (31 sessions), 16 acute / 17 subacute / 43 chronic; 48.6k first-lick trials. Space: per animal, the top 8 PCs of the pre spout x time template (pre sessions other than the ones compared). Stats: change vs the animal's own pre, analysis_kit.boot_delta (paired animals -> sessions, animal-weighted) 95% CI; * = CI excludes 0 (primary); dagger = epoch_change_lmm p < .05 (backup); k/4 = animals above their own pre mean; no correction across readouts or epochs (exploratory). Fig 11.3 · Frozen, aligned and refit decoders, and the gap split (LocaNMF). Left to right: frozen, aligned (Procrustes) and refit accuracy on the held-out half (sessions open markers, shape = animal, color = epoch; filled = mean of animals ± SEM; * = change vs pre). Right: whole gap, closed by rotation and remaining, change vs pre (bars = boot_delta point, whiskers 95 % CI, markers = animals); green text = index (share closed) with its CI. Design: per animal, k = 10 PCs of single-trial (trial × bin) activity; reference = the animal’s August pre sessions (the scored pre session left out). Per session, 2-fold cross-validation over spout blocks: the calibration half fits everything session-specific, the other half is scored (alignment trials never enter decoding); session value = mean of the two folds. Frozen = pre PCs + a pre decoder (standardized multinomial logistic, C = 0.5) trained on a size-matched random set of whole pre blocks (= the calibration size). Aligned = the session’s own PCs mapped onto the pre latents, then the SAME frozen decoder: (b) orthogonal Procrustes + one scale on per-spout condition-averaged latent trajectories (calibration labels; primary), (a) label-free covariance alignment (whiten own latents, re-color with the pre covariance; axes matched through the shared components). Refit = own PCs, decoder trained on the calibration half. Data, LocaNMF (primary): the lick arm of the frozen vs refit decoding (5r / 5rm trials): each animal’s joint-LocaNMF components in 8 sub-bins of the 2 s after the first lick, z-scored per feature on the session’s engaged trials; cued trials with a camera-seen lick (LP licks, LP-inclusive gate: DAQ contact OR LP attempt); August-only pre; render profile cohort1_rebuild_20261103. Stats: change vs own pre, analysis_kit.boot_delta (paired animals → sessions, animal-weighted, 2,000 draws); * = 95 % CI excludes 0 (uncorrected). Index = d(aligned − frozen) / d(refit − frozen), ratio of the paired draws. Gate (Priya 11-09): pre → pre alignment efficiency (aligned − 1/6) / (frozen − 1/6) ≥ .7 in ≥ 3 / 4 animals. Verdict: re-embedded = index ≥ .67 in ≥ 3 / 4 and the remaining gap not changed; replaced = index ≤ .33 in ≥ 3 / 4 and the closed part not changed; else partial. Script: scripts/aligned_decoder.py. File: rebuild_20261103/labcams/grant_figures/LP_licks_gateLP_..._inmem-epoch/epoch/data/aligned_decoder/aligned_split.png",
